# Corpus-diversity single-block combat, both sides carrying Haste (which
# affects only summoning-sickness eligibility, not the damage exchange
# itself -- attack.go's own eligibility check, not combatdamage.go):
# Spike Jester (3/1) attacks, Talruum Minotaur (3/3) blocks,
# both die (a mutual trade).
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
# One more advance for the state-based-action check that moves the
# lethally damaged creature(s) to the graveyard.
advance
